 famous roadside tavern. Delicious stewed beaver with ice kumis is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":1078.84,"y":479.47,"cell":2782,"i":19,"name":"The Major Tavern","note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious braised bacon with ice cider is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":588.25,"y":899.44,"cell":5526,"i":20,"name":"The Happy Tavern","note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious syrupped rat tails with misty kvass is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-27f1","type":"waterfalls","dy":54,"px":16,"x":342.36,"y":219.14,"cell":763,"i":21,"name":"Nylathrionese Waterfall","note":"A gorgeous waterfall flows here."},{"icon":"glyph-27f1","type":"waterfalls","dy":54,"px":16,"x":301.48,"y":245.4,"cell":936,"i":22,"name":"Sshaulalese Waterfall","note":"The rapids of an exceptionally beautiful waterfall."},{"icon":"glyph-2694-fe0f","type":"battlefields","dy":52,"x":672.52,"y":566.84,"cell":3392,"i":23,"name":"Zriokots Battlefield","note":"A historical battle of the Voraban Rebellion. \r\nDate: April 22, 396 Cudmin Era."},{"icon":"glyph-2694-fe0f","type":"battlefields","dy":52,"x":184.12,"y":482.57,"cell":2714,"i":24,"name":"Froi Battlefield","note":"A historical battle of the Zrian Invasion. \r\nDate: July 22, 620 Cudmin Era."},{"icon":"glyph-2694-fe0f","type":"battlefields","dy":52,"x":858.68,"y":428.63,"cell":2342,"i":25,"name":"Liriathannor Battlefield","note":"A historical battle of the Linderas War. \r\nDate: February 20, 421 Cudmin Era."},{"icon":"glyph-2694-fe0f","type":"battlefields","dy":52,"x":1046.34,"y":404.42,"cell":2150,"i":26,"name":"Arionnocrin Battlefield","note":"A historical battle of the Haulshan War. \r\nDate: April 13, 548 Cudmin Era."},{"icon":"glyph-1f5dd-fe0f","type":"dungeons","dy":51,"px":13,"x":499.4,"y":135.86,"cell":303,"i":27,"name":"Dungeon","note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=731204303\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=731204303\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5dd-fe0f","type":"dungeons","dy":51,"px":13,"x":1202.7,"y":864.4,"cell":5397,"i":28,"name":"Dungeon","note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=7312045397\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=7312045397\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5dd-fe0f","type":"dungeons","dy":51,"px":13,"x":627.13,"y":662.56,"cell":4004,"i":29,"name":"Dungeon","note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=7312044004\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=7312044004\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f991","type":"sea-monsters","x":323.84,"y":825.92,"cell":5168,"i":30,"name":"Durlistow Monster","note":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 29 ft long."},{"icon":"glyph-1f479","type":"hill-monsters","dy":54,"px":13,"x":396.17,"y":562.3,"cell":3371,"i":31,"name":"Joim Dragon","note":"Inscriptions speak of a huge Dragon who inhabits Joim hills and keeps the region at bay."},{"icon":"glyph-1f479","type":"hill-monsters","dy":54,"px":13,"x":1071.49,"y":189.84,"cell":651,"i":32,"name":"Presham Hag","note":"Locals speak of a proud Hag who inhabits Presham hills and harasses travelers in the area."},{"icon":"glyph-1f333","type":"sacred-forests","x":949.01,"y":818.44,"cell":5131,"i":33,"name":"Unyueg Forest","note":"A forest sacred to local Quenian (Elfish)ism."},{"icon":"glyph-1f333","type":"sacred-forests","x":890.91,"y":700.08,"cell":4291,"i":34,"name":"Lylvemargor Forest","note":"A forest sacred to local Quenian (Elfish)ism."},{"icon":"glyph-1f332","type":"sacred-pineries","px":13,"x":1338.23,"y":392.37,"cell":2072,"i":35,"name":"Eldarc Pinery","note":"A pinery sacred to local Aritheivalz Deities."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":1106.06,"y":406.03,"cell":2155,"i":36,"name":"Thenorerin Snakes","note":"A gang of mounted robbers."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":660.99,"y":834.75,"cell":5194,"i":37,"name":"Bridfairde Owls","note":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":1072.67,"y":874.51,"cell":5442,"i":38,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":1240,"y":599.8,"cell":3617,"i":39,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":814.47,"y":543.19,"cell":3212,"i":40,"name":"Nozig Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802\ud802\udc3c\udc31\ud802\ud802\ud802\udc0b\udc11\udc17\udc1f\ud802\udc2a \ud802\ud802\udc1b\udc1a\udc0c\ud802\udc20\ud802\ud802\udc01\udc04\udc35\ud802\udc30\udc0c\ud802\ud802\udc18\ud802\udc34\ud802\ud802\udc24\udc27\ud802\udc31\ud802\udc33\udc02\udc27\udc15 \ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\udc29\ud802\ud802\ud802\udc1b\udc1e\udc22\udc0f\udc22\ud802\ud802\udc03\udc31\ud802\udc1b\udc29\ud802\udc21\udc15\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1148.34,"y":538.6,"cell":3237,"i":41,"name":"Liheilean Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc2c\ud802\udc35\udc1c\udc25\udc17\ud802\ud802\ud802\udc17\udc1a\ud802\udc1e\ud802\udc08\udc2e\udc2f\udc0c\udc0a \udc28\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\udc32\udc08\udc02\udc15\udc04\udc1e\ud802\ud802\ud802\udc11\udc20 \udc0c\udc14\ud802\udc03\udc13 \ud802\ud802\udc24\udc32\udc3c\ud802\ud802  \ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\udc3f\udc04\udc04\udc03\udc0a\udc2f\ud802\udc21\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":591.39,"y":600.43,"cell":3656,"i":42,"name":"Ruined Settlement","note":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":776.43,"y":399.49,"cell":2130,"i":43,"name":"Ruined Town","note":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1084.79,"y":837.04,"cell":5318,"i":44,"name":"Ruined Stronghold","note":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4da","type":"libraries","x":1295.55,"y":493.48,"cell":2911,"i":45,"name":"Umanilseladi Archive","note":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":920.76,"y":376.78,"cell":1940,"i":46,"name":"Travelling Incomprehensible Circus","note":"Roll up, roll up, this incomprehensible circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":1004.09,"y":605.23,"cell":3687,"i":47,"name":"Travelling Breathtaking Circus","note":"Roll up, roll up, this breathtaking circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f93a","type":"jousts","dx":48,"x":253.98,"y":758.1,"cell":4614,"i":48,"name":"Slukex Competition","note":"Warriors from around the land gather for a competition of brutality in Slukex, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3a0","type":"fairs","x":619.22,"y":589.73,"cell":3568,"i":49,"name":"Eenqi Fair","note":"A fair is being held in Eenqi, offering local coal, bronze, and artillery alongside foreign goods and services."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6f6","type":"canoes","x":717.54,"y":618.91,"cell":3755,"i":50,"name":"Minor Jetty","note":"A small location along the Gundukkhur River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"icon":"glyph-1f417","type":"migration","x":370.07,"y":489.95,"cell":2728,"i":51,"name":"Martens migration","note":"A huge group of martens are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":988.8,"y":352.37,"cell":1742,"i":52,"name":"Nellorthyr Cavern","note":"The Nellorthyr Cavern. Locals claim that it is a good spot to hid treasure."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":697.4,"y":541.76,"cell":3203,"i":53,"name":"Stiolx Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":1001.06,"y":585.51,"cell":3597,"i":54,"name":"Cyhserin Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":488.64,"y":824.51,"cell":5181,"i":55,"name":"Wathasinx Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":956.72,"y":783.82,"cell":4940,"i":56,"name":"Thelionlurth Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":1147.09,"y":413.17,"cell":2258,"i":57,"name":"Eshtarion Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":1340.05,"y":451.96,"cell":2588,"i":58,"name":"Aritheivalz Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":1069.98,"y":481.02,"cell":2781,"i":59,"name":"Ullhosea Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":814.69,"y":612.04,"cell":3762,"i":60,"name":"Abaram Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":931.63,"y":362.86,"cell":1842,"i":61,"name":"Nythenas Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f386","type":"rifts","x":1018.41,"y":475.41,"cell":2670,"i":62,"name":"Demonic Rift","note":"A rumoured demonic rift in this area is causing an emmissary to step through with an all-powerful relic."},{"icon":"glyph-1f480","type":"disturbed-burials","x":940.39,"y":391.96,"cell":2042,"i":63,"name":"Disturbed Burial","note":"A burial site has been disturbed in this area, causing the dead to rise and attack the living."},{"icon":"glyph-1f480","type":"disturbed-burials","x":764.04,"y":814.44,"cell":5107,"i":64,"name":"Disturbed Burial","note":"A burial site has been disturbed in this area, causing the dead to rise and attack the living."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1054.42,"y":279.49,"cell":1267,"i":65,"name":"Bretleton Tomb","note":"A sprawling necropolis built within a labyrinthine network of catacombs. Its halls are lined with countless alcoves, each housing the remains of the departed, while the distant sound of rattling bones fills the air."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1059.22,"y":188.65,"cell":650,"i":66,"name":"Craftham Crypt","note":"This ethereal necropolis seems suspended between the realms of the living and the dead. Wisps of mist dance around the tombstones, while haunting melodies linger in the air, commemorating the departed."},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":1177.89,"y":701.32,"cell":4312,"i":67,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/4312\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":560.44,"y":826.9,"cell":5187,"i":68,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/5187\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":1358.32,"y":339.94,"cell":1673,"i":69,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/1673\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":974.04,"y":362.69,"cell":1845,"i":70,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/1845\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":1197.86,"y":761.19,"cell":4778,"i":71,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/4778\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":695.54,"y":525.78,"cell":3098,"i":72,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/3098\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"gl